  "body": "## Scope\n\nExisting-game maintenance for **Battlestar Galactica: The Board Game**, limited to the English 2008 **base game** under the corrected online rulebook. **Expansions are excluded.**\n\n## Coverage\n\n- **Governing rules corpus:** **5/5 = 100%**. Numerator: all five direct official PDFs were acquired, identity/page count/hash checked, and their applicable standard-base-game content represented in the six rule-category records. Denominator: corrected base-game rulebook, latest FAQ/errata v2.1, Game Setup reference, Resolving Player Turns and Special Events reference, and Lines of Succession and Rules for Combat reference.\n- **Components:** **34/34 = 100%**. Numerator: all 34 categories have an official quantity and gameplay purpose in `rules/setup.okf.md`. Denominator: **34 official leaf categories** in the corrected rulebook's component list; the four parent rollups (52 tokens, 110 large cards, 128 small cards, and 32 ships) are arithmetic checksums, not additional denominator rows.\n\n## Official source authorities\n\nFantasy Flight Games is the official authority for all six URLs below:\n\n- Product/support inventory: https://www.fantasyflightgames.com/en/products/battlestar-galactica/\n- Corrected 32-page base-game rulebook: https://images-cdn.fantasyflightgames.com/filer_public/0c/0c/0c0cc32c-6394-448c-b5c0-9307f85dfc74/bsg_rulebook_web.pdf\n- FAQ and Errata v2.1: https://images-cdn.fantasyflightgames.com/filer_public/bd/e5/bde5f362-34dd-4f8b-a611-5d8d21765c83/bsg_faq_2-1_hi-res.pdf\n- Game Setup reference: https://images-cdn.fantasyflightgames.com/ffg_content/Battlestar_Galactica/Reference_Sheet_Game_Setup_Reference%20Sheet_eng.pdf\n- Resolving Player Turns and Special Events reference: https://images-cdn.fantasyflightgames.com/filer_public/47/f6/47f601ed-849a-4cbf-84ef-ad1a3e4420f2/reference_sheet_player_turns_eng.pdf\n- Lines of Succession and Rules for Combat reference: https://images-cdn.fantasyflightgames.com/filer_public/3e/d6/3ed67a6d-8067-41b4-870c-8c14bb72440a/reference_sheet_succession_and_combat_reference_sheet_eng.pdf\n\n## Changed rules documents\n\n- `rules/overview.okf.md`\n- `rules/setup.okf.md`\n- `rules/turn-structure.okf.md`\n- `rules/actions.okf.md`\n- `rules/scoring-endgame.okf.md`\n- `rules/edge-cases-faq.okf.md`\n\nAlso updates the game's `index.okf.md`, `sources.okf.md`, and `scout-report.okf.md`, plus the deterministic BoardGames index and `TELEMETRY.md`.\n\n## Checks already run\n\n- All nine changed target-game OKF documents: clean.\n- Full OKF validator: **2,611 files clean**, with BoardGames index fresh.\n- Node intake/provenance suite: **31 pass, 0 fail, 1 intentional skip**.\n- `git diff --check`: clean.\n- GitHub Actions `validate`: **passed** in 33s on exact head `722e76769cc7d67f14b0e84d1272413f865663f9` ([run 30610863629 / job 91093089398](https://github.com/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/actions/runs/30610863629/job/91093089398)).\n\n## Known gaps and exclusions\n\n- Excluded from both denominators: Pegasus, Exodus, Daybreak, all expansion rules/modules/components, the separate Optional Rules variant sheet, corrected-card image artifacts already superseded by corrected rules/FAQ, promotional material, translations, replacement parts, and older superseded FAQ versions.\n- The consolidated references and FAQ include expansion material; only their standard-base-game branches and generally applicable rulings are represented.\n- The Fantasy Flight Games product page challenged the latest automated recheck with Cloudflare. All five governing direct PDFs remained retrievable and hash-verifiable. Mennonite should manually reopen the product page to detect any later standard-base-game additions.\n\n## Authorship and audit boundary\n\n- `Bathcat-Authored: true`\n- `Audit-Owner: Mennonite`\n- Exact head SHA: `722e76769cc7d67f14b0e84d1272413f865663f9`\n- Mennonite owns the independent audit and is the **only role permitted to merge**. Bathcat will not approve, promote, or merge this PR.\n",
